### Workflow examples

The project ships with [Mistral Workflows](https://docs.mistral.ai/capabilities/workflows/) integration via the [`mistralai-workflows-plugins-search`](https://pypi.org/project/mistralai-workflows-plugins-search/) plugin, providing durable ingestion pipelines with retries and observability in the Mistral Console.

**Terminal 1 — start the worker (leave this running):**

```bash
make start-examples
```

**Terminal 2 — trigger ingestion:**

```bash
make execute-ingestion file_path=sample_data/hello.txt
```

Requires `DEPLOYMENT_NAME` in `.env` (set during `copier copy`). See [`examples/workflows/README.md`](examples/workflows/README.md) for details.

